# What the image is built from is Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock and src/. Everything else stays
# out of the build context: target/ and testdata/ are gigabytes, and a context that changes
# when a test writes a file rebuilds the image for nothing.
#
# Of crates/kibbr-devtools only the manifest: Cargo will not build a workspace with a
# member's manifest missing, and needs nothing else of a member it does not build. An edit
# to the bench then never rebuilds the image.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!crates/kibbr-devtools/Cargo.toml
!LICENSE
